From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:47:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: amvdec: add Amlogic S7 support

The S7 video decoder is the S4 one, with the decoder settings of the
newer generations, like S6:
 - the canvas LUT is in the DOS bus (MDEC_CAV_*), there is no DMC
   canvas for the decoder;
 - the AV1 microcode needs the host parser setup and swaps the RPM
   words, as on T7 and S6.

The DMC port parking follows the vendor driver: the channel status
word is 0xcc (byte 0x330), VDEC_1 is bit 8 and HEVC is bit 7 only, as
S7 has no separate HEVC back-end port.

S7 also moves HEVC_SLICE_DATA_CTL, HEVC_STREAM_CRC and VP9_ACP_CTRL,
but the driver uses none of them, so no register remap is needed.

Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c |  2 ++
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c  | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h  |  1 +
 3 files changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
index 8726d29..30df5df 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
@@ -1540,6 +1540,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id vdec_dt_match[] = {
 	  .data = &meson_amvdec_platform_t7 },
 	{ .compatible = "amlogic,s6-vdec",
 	  .data = &meson_amvdec_platform_s6 },
+	{ .compatible = "amlogic,s7-vdec",
+	  .data = &meson_amvdec_platform_s7 },
 	{}
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, vdec_dt_match);
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c
index 05563ea..4cd4912 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c
@@ -663,6 +663,24 @@ const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_s6 = {
 	.dos_reg_s6 = true,
 };
 
+/*
+ * S7: the S4 decoder with the DOS-bus canvas and the T7/S6 AV1 handling.
+ * DMC port parking as on S6 but with its own status word (0xcc) and only
+ * the HEVC front-end port (bit 7). The DOS register layout is the S4 one
+ * for everything the driver touches.
+ */
+const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_s7 = {
+	.formats = amvdec_formats_s4,
+	.num_formats = ARRAY_SIZE(amvdec_formats_s4),
+	.revision = AMVDEC_REVISION_S4,
+	.dmc_chan_sts = 0x330,
+	.dmc_vdec_mask = BIT(8),
+	.dmc_hevc_mask = BIT(7),
+	.dos_canvas = true,
+	.av1_host_parser = true,
+	.av1_rpm_swap = true,
+};
+
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("amrisc/amrisc_vc1.bin");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("meson/vdec/g12a_h264_multi.bin");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("meson/vdec/g12a_hevc_mmu.bin");
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h
index 7c418cc..7aa49e6 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h
@@ -76,5 +76,6 @@ extern const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_s4;
 extern const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_sc2;
 extern const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_t7;
 extern const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_s6;
+extern const struct amvdec_platform meson_amvdec_platform_s7;
 
 #endif
-- 
